config BR2_PACKAGE_FONT_SYMBOLS_NERD
	bool "font-symbols-nerd"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_FONTCONFIG
	help
	  Symbols Nerd Font (and its Mono variant): the Nerd Fonts icon
	  glyphs alone, in the Private Use Area, with no letters.
	  starship's default prompt (the comfort shell), powerline
	  prompts, eza --icons and lazygit draw these; without a font
	  that has them every icon is a box. fontconfig's per-glyph
	  fallback finds them under any terminal font. Upstream's
	  10-nerd-font-symbols.conf is not installed: it makes this font
	  the preferred "monospace", which fallback does not need.

	  https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts
